# (CR 608.2h, 701.24a).
[Bot1 Deck]
Visions
Mox Pearl
Island x5
Forest
Plains
Mountain
Swamp
Ornithopter
Memnite
Island x5

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
